    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659650/extras/d009bd6c89d76dafe42c3aeee1f38318.avif?t=1741403668\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659650/extras/075da0f36343c06730d67dee0b507907.avif?t=1741403668\" /></div><br>After passing out in the woods near your camping site you hear a loud rumbling and the sound of falling rocks. Returning to your tent you see it has been crushed.<br><br>In 7th Chance you will explore a twisted version of our own reality where you are confronted with the demons of your past and present.<br><br>The game is a linear story-based game designed to be played in one sitting and <strong>will take 15mins (one ending) to 30mins (complete story + achievements).</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659650/extras/4aabdf835972f7b9f661fff2c3e7f143.avif?t=1741403668\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659650/extras/c80ed0fa836b66b281d517fb857836c9.avif?t=1741403668\" /></div><br>Each choice should not be taken lightly, as they will affect the outcome and if the world decides to offer punishment or salvation.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659650/extras/72129295b2b15a47a3220b944cf92cec.avif?t=1741403668\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659650/extras/c97cec2de1528df4e51b46612fb28ef9.avif?t=1741403668\" /></div><br>Hey, I'm Andrew from DrewidGames. After years of working on projects far too big that went nowhere, I decided to focus my efforts on making a solo indie adventure game. I hope you enjoy it!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659650/extras/d009bd6c89d76dafe42c3aeee1f38318.avif?t=1741403668\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659650/extras/075da0f36343c06730d67dee0b507907.avif?t=1741403668\" /></div><br>After passing out in the woods near your camping site you hear a loud rumbling and the sound of falling rocks. Returning to your tent you see it has been crushed.<br><br>In 7th Chance you will explore a twisted version of our own reality where you are confronted with the demons of your past and present.<br><br>The game is a linear story-based game designed to be played in one sitting and <strong>will take 15mins (one ending) to 30mins (complete story + achievements).</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659650/extras/4aabdf835972f7b9f661fff2c3e7f143.avif?t=1741403668\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659650/extras/c80ed0fa836b66b281d517fb857836c9.avif?t=1741403668\" /></div><br>Each choice should not be taken lightly, as they will affect the outcome and if the world decides to offer punishment or salvation.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659650/extras/72129295b2b15a47a3220b944cf92cec.avif?t=1741403668\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659650/extras/c97cec2de1528df4e51b46612fb28ef9.avif?t=1741403668\" /></div><br>Hey, I'm Andrew from DrewidGames. After years of working on projects far too big that went nowhere, I decided to focus my efforts on making a solo indie adventure game. I hope you enjoy it!",
